WEBVTT

00:00:00.367 --> 00:00:02.900
Are you a SMART fella,

00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:04.933
or a FART smella?

00:00:04.933 --> 00:00:06.433
Let's find OUT!

00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:08.167
Alright,

00:00:08.167 --> 00:00:09.867
a word analogy!

00:00:09.867 --> 00:00:12.167
Hard is to soft,

00:00:12.167 --> 00:00:14.433
as heavy is to...

00:00:14.433 --> 00:00:15.000
what?

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:15.567
A.

00:00:15.567 --> 00:00:16.167
Rock,

00:00:16.167 --> 00:00:16.733
B.

00:00:16.733 --> 00:00:17.300
Light,

00:00:17.300 --> 00:00:17.867
C.

00:00:17.867 --> 00:00:18.433
Strong,

00:00:18.433 --> 00:00:19.567
or D.

00:00:19.567 --> 00:00:20.133
Big?

00:00:20.133 --> 00:00:21.267
Five seconds!

00:00:27.067 --> 00:00:28.267
TIME'S UP!

00:00:28.933 --> 00:00:29.433
It's...

00:00:29.433 --> 00:00:29.933
B,

00:00:29.933 --> 00:00:30.467
light!

00:00:30.467 --> 00:00:33.000
Hard and soft are opposites,

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:36.533
so the opposite of heavy is light.

00:00:37.700 --> 00:00:38.267
Okay,

00:00:38.267 --> 00:00:39.933
a picture puzzle!

00:00:39.933 --> 00:00:43.300
Where does the dot move next?

00:00:43.300 --> 00:00:43.867
A.

00:00:43.867 --> 00:00:44.433
Center,

00:00:44.433 --> 00:00:44.967
B.

00:00:44.967 --> 00:00:45.533
Bottom-right,

00:00:45.533 --> 00:00:46.100
C.

00:00:46.100 --> 00:00:46.667
Top-left,

00:00:46.667 --> 00:00:47.767
or D.

00:00:47.767 --> 00:00:48.333
Bottom-left?

00:00:48.333 --> 00:00:49.467
Five seconds!

00:00:55.233 --> 00:00:56.433
TIME'S UP!

00:00:57.100 --> 00:00:58.500
The answer is...

00:00:58.500 --> 00:00:58.967
D,

00:00:58.967 --> 00:00:59.433
bottom-left!

00:00:59.433 --> 00:01:01.300
The dot steps counter-clockwise

00:01:01.300 --> 00:01:02.700
around the corners,

00:01:02.700 --> 00:01:05.500
so the next spot is bottom-left.

00:01:06.667 --> 00:01:07.333
Alright,

00:01:07.333 --> 00:01:09.333
a number analogy!

00:01:09.333 --> 00:01:11.300
Four makes eleven,

00:01:11.300 --> 00:01:13.300
five makes fourteen,

00:01:13.300 --> 00:01:15.300
six makes seventeen,

00:01:15.300 --> 00:01:17.267
so seven makes...

00:01:17.267 --> 00:01:17.933
what?

00:01:17.933 --> 00:01:18.600
A.

00:01:18.600 --> 00:01:19.267
Twenty,

00:01:19.267 --> 00:01:19.933
B.

00:01:19.933 --> 00:01:20.600
Twenty-five,

00:01:20.600 --> 00:01:21.233
C.

00:01:21.233 --> 00:01:21.900
Twenty-two,

00:01:21.900 --> 00:01:23.233
or D.

00:01:23.233 --> 00:01:23.900
Twenty-three?

00:01:23.900 --> 00:01:25.233
Five seconds!

00:01:31.000 --> 00:01:32.200
TIME'S UP!

00:01:32.867 --> 00:01:33.367
It's...

00:01:33.367 --> 00:01:33.867
A,

00:01:33.867 --> 00:01:34.400
twenty!

00:01:34.400 --> 00:01:37.433
Each number is multiplied by three

00:01:37.433 --> 00:01:39.467
then take away one,

00:01:39.467 --> 00:01:41.500
so seven becomes twenty.

00:01:42.667 --> 00:01:43.067
So,

00:01:43.067 --> 00:01:45.100
are you smart or fart?

00:01:45.100 --> 00:01:47.533
Count up your correct answers to

00:01:47.533 --> 00:01:48.733
find your rank!

00:01:49.900 --> 00:01:50.233
So,

00:01:50.233 --> 00:01:51.633
how did you do?

00:01:51.633 --> 00:01:53.000
Comment your score below,

00:01:53.000 --> 00:01:54.367
and follow for more!
